The English Text files Contained In this archive Are freely distributable
and have been created for the EXCELLENT typing door HyperTyper By Wim Rumping

There is A text file for everyday If needed to give your users a very good
choice and testing challange. You can set a cron event/Script or whatever to
Rotate the Text files over the full 7 days. I've tested the Changing over of 
text files Even With a user in the door and playing Hypertyper and it has 
Worked Flawlessly.

System used A3000 KS 37.175 WB 2.1 10 Megs 32bit ram DLG V1.0 

Thanks Wim For an excellent door and keep up the good work.

